108
00:04:58,873 --> 00:04:59,703
Oh yeah!

109
00:04:59,786 --> 00:05:00,616
What kind of guy was he?

110
00:05:00,699 --> 00:05:01,529
Hmm.

111
00:05:01,612 --> 00:05:03,177
Well he looked just

112
