155
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:21,601
You're interested in me, are you?

156
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,960
The story is quite simple.

157
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:28,857
At a certain point in the past,
before we came to these waters,

158
00:07:28,940 --> 00:07:31,411
my crew left behind a good friend of ours.

159
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:34,697
It was a troubling situation,
but we did it out of necessity.

160
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:37,317
The only consolation we
could offer this friend was a

161
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:39,817
promise that we would return
one day no matter the cost!

162
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:45,417
But then the crew was annihilated and the
promise that we made was left unfulfilled.

163
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:48,757
Since I am the only survivor,

164
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:52,937
it is my duty to return to our
friend even if I must bear sad news.

165
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:56,000
How long has it been
since the day we died?

166
00:07:57,020 --> 00:08:00,177
