169
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:06,300
I wasn't even born yet.

170
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,277
I hate to break it to you, buddy,

171
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:10,577
but there's no way your
friend's still waiting for you.

172
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:11,836
You don't know that!

173
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:18,077
But it's true that he would have
every right to leave by now.

174
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:21,395
