against the dividing wall

212
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:16,177
He spent 50 years waiting
for his friends there

213
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:19,260
believing they'd return
for him after their voyage.

214
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:29,877
I couldn't believe it,

215
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,977
but somehow Luffy convinced
him to stop trying

216
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:34,497
