wall like a damned idiot.

217
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:36,420
Even now, he's alive out there.

218
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:43,395
Waiting at that cape for his
friends to finally return.

219
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,220
It's an incredible story.

220
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,020
Talk about true friends.

221
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:51,197
He kept his promise to them
for more than half a century.

222
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:55,540
And to think, we met one of Laboon's
friends by complete coincidence.

223
00:11:58,640 --> 00:12:01,228
Wonder what that
skeleton's doing right now.

224
