I won't deny that you've gotten stronger
over these past five years, but so have I!

225
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:19,940
And remember, I already know
every move you're gonna make!

226
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:37,060
You care more about that damn
afro than the skull beneath it.

227
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:40,789
Too bad for you, it's the biggest
target on your whole body.

228
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:42,020
Shut up!

229
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:53,180
Laboon, I wonder, old friend, after all
these years, do you still remember me?

230
00:12:57,260 --> 00:13:02,500
When I think of how alone you must
have felt, it breaks my heart in two.

231
