Although, I don't suppose
I have a heart anymore.

232
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,880
The Couran line is so fearsome.

233
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:15,640
Believe me, I tried as hard as I could.

234
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:20,780
I tried to bring them back to you, but
all of our friends have passed away.

235
00:13:28,860 --> 00:13:31,857
Not only have I lost our friends I lost my

236
00:13:31,940 --> 00:13:35,537
face my body my shadow
everything I once was.

237
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:38,757
If we were to meet again
you probably wouldn't

238
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:41,880
