287
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,957
You remember what that
geezer zombie told us?

288
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,900
I saw you fight those zombies.

289
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:56,040
All of you have such
unbelievable strength. All right.

290
00:16:56,260 --> 00:16:58,017
