291
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:01,317
There's an evil man who
must be brought down.

292
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:04,377
And I think you youngsters
are strong enough to do it.

293
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:06,817
He's left a trail of victims in his wake.

294
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:09,437
If you defeat him, they'll all be rescued.

295
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:13,820
All we've got to do to free the
shadows is put an end to Gecko Moria.

296
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:17,100
He said that, huh?

297
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:20,432
