298
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:27,380
Up there, Gecko Moria's just sitting
on his big ass waiting for us? What?

299
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:28,980
Are you nuts?

300
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,320
What do you mean?

301
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:33,717
His butt's asking for a kicking,
so that's what I'm gonna do.

302
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:35,976
And then all the shadows will return.

303
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:37,340
Sanji, fire up.

304
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:38,940
You're rescuing Nami.

305
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,480
That's exactly what I wanted to hear!

306
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:46,697
That Invisible Man's gonna be the
Divisible Man when I'm done with him.

307
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:49,015
