more fuel to the fire?

314
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:13,317
Do you not seem angry enough to you?

315
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:15,397
I feel like it's all my fault since I let

316
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,457
