right in front of my eyes.

317
00:18:17,540 --> 00:18:19,716
It's only right that I go with Sanji!

318
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:23,157
And also I'll do anything to
stay away from that Moria.

319
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:26,077
I'm worried about the skeleton
fighting on his own he needs

320
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:30,177
backup if Straw Hat beats Moria
before the skeleton zombie wins?

321
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:31,257
Then everything's cool.

322
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:35,977
Otherwise, I got to work overtime to help
Brooke and hold on to my own damn shadow

323
00:18:36,060 --> 00:18:38,297
I'll give you some extra
backup with that one Franky.

324
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:41,677
I Want to see if this legendary
samurai he's fighting lives up

325
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:46,880
to his reputation or not if we're picking
nami's my top priority That's the battle.

326
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:50,196
I'd like to lend my hands
to and once we get her back.

327
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:54,440
We can all take down Moria as a team
You say it like it's no big deal,

328
