343
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:24,940
Ah, so this is what you
were whipping up earlier.

344
00:19:25,220 --> 00:19:26,867
That's good thinking, Usopp.

345
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:28,070
All right.

346
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:31,917
If we're gonna do this thing, there's
one point I cannot stress enough.

347
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,697
There may be a lot of thick
forests on this island to hide in,

348
