because it's the middle of the night.

350
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:44,860
In other words, sunrise
is our literal deadline.

351
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:47,237
We have to get your shadows back by then.

352
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:48,680
