needs to be properly broken in here.

380
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:11,238
It'll be obedient before you know it

381
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:13,690
Yes,

382
00:21:13,773 --> 00:21:16,277
it's all in order with all
that my command we can't be

383
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:20,066
