gather even more powerful shadows

384
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:21,597
Before you know it,

385
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:25,680
our undead army will be stocked
full of unstoppable special zombies.

386
00:21:27,460 --> 00:21:31,337
We're gonna need a mountain of those
marionettes for what we have in store.

387
00:21:31,420 --> 00:21:32,320
Hey, Hogback.

388
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:34,140
Leave it to me, master.

389
00:21:41,020 --> 00:21:42,420
Dr. Hogback! Huh?

390
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:44,830
Emergency!

391
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,680
The pirates, the pirates!

392
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:53,677
What's the matter Hilda those
three pirates whose shadows we just

393
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:57,017
claimed they woke up somehow and now
they're coming back here with all

394
00:21:57,100 --> 00:22:01,937
their friends what impossible no
one wakes up that quickly after the

395
00:22:02,020 --> 00:22:05,757
shadow's taken i i didn't see it
myself but their friends seem to have

396
00:22:05,840 --> 00:22:08,997
beaten them awake anyway it also
seems that they're in cahoots with

397
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:11,637
the humming swordsman that's
probably where they're getting their

398
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:15,237
information from the one thing i
do know for certain is that he He

399
