explained to the pirates how to purify
the zombies and release their shadows!

400
00:22:20,320 --> 00:22:21,150
What?!

401
00:22:22,780 --> 00:22:25,357
All the zombies are
terrified for their lives!

402
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,417
The pirates have got them on the run!

403
00:22:27,500 --> 00:22:30,337
The wild zombies, surprise
zombies, the zombie soldiers!

404
00:22:30,420 --> 00:22:32,397
None of them stand a chance
against these maniacs,

405
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:34,833
even if they didn't have salt with them!

406
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:37,885
Our only option is to
call the zombie generals!

407
00:22:38,840 --> 00:22:42,477
But if they manage to purify
them, then the pirates might win!

408
00:22:42,560 --> 00:22:43,837
We need Absalom!

409
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,449
What the hell is he doing?

410
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:51,800
Uh, well, um, I'm pretty sure
