Anyway, everything seems to be in order.

437
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,078
No reason to worry.

438
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:25,160
Ah, it seems that way.

439
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:26,560
Talk about boring.

440
00:24:27,080 --> 00:24:28,817
So you're just gonna sit there?

441
00:24:28,900 --> 00:24:31,197
Is it any wonder why
you're always so bored?

442
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:33,977
Well, I'm not bored
enough to bother standing.

443
00:24:34,060 --> 00:24:36,354
I'll just wait here for Oz to get back.

444
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:39,180
Well then, may I ask a simple request?

445
00:24:39,980 --> 00:24:40,810
Huh?

446
00:24:40,980 --> 00:24:43,392
If it doesn't make any difference to you,

447
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:46,501
could I be second in command
over Absalom zombies?

448
00:24:50,520 --> 00:24:51,720
Ah, Moria!

449
00:24:52,580 --> 00:24:54,620
Where the hell are you? No, crap!

450
00:24:56,540 --> 00:24:58,417
