452
00:25:01,760 --> 00:25:05,557
Which one of you is the sick bastard
that spied on Nami in the back?

453
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:07,720
It wasn't me, I swear it!

454
00:25:07,980 --> 00:25:09,000
Show yourself!

455
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:14,839
You know, we might not even
need the salt after all.

456
00:25:14,940 --> 00:25:17,057
Their anger's doing the job just fine.

457
00:25:17,140 --> 00:25:19,357
