more of them on the bridge below.

460
00:25:25,700 --> 00:25:27,582
There's no way we can beat them.

461
00:25:31,380 --> 00:25:35,117
I can't believe these slow stupid
pieces of crap managed to capture me.

462
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:37,257
The more I think about it,
the more it pisses me off!

463
00:25:37,340 --> 00:25:40,237
I'm sure you developed a pretty
close bond to me after I saved you.

464
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:41,937
Feel free to call me bro if you want.

465
00:25:42,020 --> 00:25:43,667
I'd rather get caught again.

466
00:25:45,800 --> 00:25:48,720
Oh no, not good? What is it? What's wrong?

467
00:25:49,320 --> 00:25:51,857
I don't even deserve to be human.

468
00:25:51,940 --> 00:25:54,040
I wish I was a mosquito.

469
00:25:54,900 --> 00:25:55,997
I'm so ashamed.

470
00:25:56,080 --> 00:25:59,020
My soul is as twisted
as my curly eyebrows.

471
00:25:59,220 --> 00:26:03,000
Hey, Luffy, Sanji, why are you
just lying there? What the hell?

472
00:26:03,220 --> 00:26:04,357
What happened to them?

473
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:06,497
Those ghosts suck the will out of them.

474
00:26:06,580 --> 00:26:08,737
One touch from them and
they break your spirit.

475
00:26:08,820 --> 00:26:11,702
I know that much, but I
don't know how to fix it.

476
00:26:12,260 --> 00:26:14,980
All right, Call, we betcha now.

477
00:26:15,740 --> 00:26:17,320
Damn it. Here goes.

478
00:26:17,900 --> 00:26:18,730
Blitzstar!

479
00:26:23,120 --> 00:26:24,480
Run for it!

480
00:26:27,340 --> 00:26:30,399
We'll never get off this
ship if they catch us, too!

481
00:26:31,140 --> 00:26:32,657
