496
00:27:24,860 --> 00:27:27,077
Usopp, Sanjit, those zombies, everyone.

497
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:29,219
They all fell down with the stairs.

498
00:27:33,660 --> 00:27:36,017
Their legs are twitching,
so I'm sure they're fine.

499
00:27:36,100 --> 00:27:37,453
Nothing to worry about.

500
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:39,896
What I'm curious about is this thing.

501
00:27:40,040 --> 00:27:42,687
Well, whatever it is,
it's blocking our path.

502
00:27:43,340 --> 00:27:45,160
Sure is a weird-looking wall.

503
00:27:51,500 --> 00:27:52,330
Damn it.

504
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:54,060
What the hell was that?

505
00:27:57,020 --> 00:27:58,600
I think it was.

506
00:28:02,620 --> 00:28:04,060
It's not made of rock.

507
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,440
Weapons left!

508
00:28:08,780 --> 00:28:09,610
What the?

509
00:28:09,693 --> 00:28:11,542
It didn't even put a dent in it.

510
00:28:12,320 --> 00:28:13,150
Ah!

511
00:28:13,233 --> 00:28:14,641
What the hell are you guys doing?

512
00:28:15,580 --> 00:28:16,740
It's just a wall.

513
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:18,437
A big, pink, fleshy wall.

514
00:28:18,520 --> 00:28:20,677
That's not a wall you moron!

515
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:22,380
That thing's loopy soppy!

516
00:28:22,820 --> 00:28:23,780
No way!
